    "body": "fix on issue/3995-ui-link-stale-discovery · PR #4020 · pinned by ui_link_owner::a_crashed_windows_file_is_removed_and_its_port_is_never_dialed, ui_link_owner::a_false_server_that_proves_the_token_gets_no_tool_call_when_the_window_has_ended, ui_link_owner::a_link_file_with_no_owner_proof_is_never_dialed · merges when reviewed\n\nThe PR uses `Refs #3995`, not `Fixes`. It closes the stale-file case: the CLI dials a link file only while its window holds an OS file lock, and it removes a stale file with a logged diagnostic. The Windows named-pipe part needs a `windows-sys` dependency and a maintainer decision. It is filed as #4016.",
